The '''PYRAMID30 Okaiken''' is a chart that ranks the best-performing singles in [[Okaiken]]. Its data, published by Nikkan Sports & Entertainment magazine, KTK Group and compiled by Okaiken Pyramid Records, is based collectively on each single's weekly physical and digital sales, as well as radio airplay and streaming. PYRAMID30 Okaiken is a subsidiary of Pyramid Records but acts as a separate organization. The weekly charts are updated every Sunday at 11:45 in the morning (UTC +9). The following lists all of the number one singles of the PYRAMID30 Okaiken for 2024.

2024 in Okaiken music was defined by the massive crossover success of domestic Hip-Hop, led by the duo [[Creepy Nuts]]. Their global hit "Bling-Bang-Bang-Born" held the top spot for a record-breaking number of weeks. The year also saw a resurgence of Western rock music on the charts, with the return of [[Linkin Park]], alongside domestic stadium rock acts like [[ONE OK ROCK]] and [[King Gnu]].

